cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this public pipeline is useful, cite the repository and the related preliminary work separately."
title: "Sports2D–DVIDEOW thesis pipeline"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-30
abstract: >-
  Public methodological companion for a thesis on the implementation and
  validation of markerless motion-analysis algorithms for futsal kicking
  asymmetry. It documents a common funnel from synchronized 2D views through
  DVIDEOW reference tracking, Sports2D, MediaPipe, DeepLabCut, DLT and
  multi-level validation without redistributing private data or results.
